DESCRIPTION:We will have our Meet-the-Teacher Night on Wednesday\, 8/19 fr
 om 6 pm - 8 pm.  We will initially have everyone meet in the Multi-Pur
 pose Room for a few quick introductions and notes about the night.  Afte
 r that\, we will run our 7-period day.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS Meet-the-Teacher Night
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Edgewood Junior High School
DTSTAMP:20260822T020304Z
UID:a57fd94a-3bba-539a-aa49-fa2ae11fe9d6
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260827T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260827T153000
DESCRIPTION:EJHS Art Club will host its first meeting of the year on Thursd
 ay\, Aug. 27th\, after school until 3:30. Make sure to have your ride pick
  you up at the front door #1. Meetings will be every Thursday in the art r
 oom\, room 216\, unless announced. All EJHS students are invited to come a
 t any point this school year.1) Students should join the club's Google Cla
 ssroom with the code awn22v2 or using the online link.https://classroom.go
 ogle.com/c/Mjg5ODM1MzUy?cjc=awn22v22) Parents/guardians and students can 
 also join EJHS Art Club 2026-27 on SportsYou with the code 4XKY-6WQC 
 to get text reminders.Download the app here: https://sportsyou.app
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS Art Club
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Edgewood Junior High School
DTSTAMP:20260822T020304Z
UID:6d527477-c2ad-5256-bd25-c1bd084a0288
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T170000
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to kick off the school year with our Back to School D
 ance – the Glow Party!Join us on Friday\, August 28\, from 2:30 to 5:00 
 PM for an afternoon of music\, dancing\, and glowing fun!Tickets are $6 if
  you purchase them ahead of time online – see this link for details! De
 adline to pre-purchase tickets is Monday\, August 24. Cash tickets can be 
 bought during lunch starting Monday\, August 24th\, or at the door to the
  event for $7. For any questions or payment issues\, please contact the PT
 O by emailing rbbejhspto@gmail.com.This event is for middle school studen
 ts only\, so don’t miss out! Grab your neon gear\, bring your energy\, a
 nd we’ll see you at the Glow Party!We also do need help with donations a
 nd limited volunteers if you’re able as well. Dances are our main form 
 of fundraising each year at EJHS\, so any support is so greatly appreciat
 ed! All proceeds go directly back to supporting EJHS students and teachers
  through your EJHS PTO.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS GLOW PARTY
END:VEVENT
